    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theta is a little girl who turns left every time she hits a wall. She is curious about the world and discovers a mysterious place, where she picked up a fork that can split her into multiple copies of herself, and from that moment, the world changes forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/6de894bfb173628e826a2c66fa4de253.poster.avif?t=1749409688\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/6de894bfb173628e826a2c66fa4de253.webm?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/6de894bfb173628e826a2c66fa4de253.mp4?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of splitting to solve puzzles and explore the truth of a world under the observation of &quot;God&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/79ef491b680265139effe0f144880185.poster.avif?t=1749409688\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/79ef491b680265139effe0f144880185.webm?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/79ef491b680265139effe0f144880185.mp4?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is expected to feature 6 main chapters, each revealing at least one hidden truth that already hides within the core mechanics of the game from the beginning. Paralldoxs are under your nose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By experiencing some abstract interpretations of modern physics, you will uncover the creation and operation of parallel worlds and other rules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/0663d86f27ab00459d707f09937b3b45.poster.avif?t=1749409688\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/0663d86f27ab00459d707f09937b3b45.webm?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/0663d86f27ab00459d707f09937b3b45.mp4?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 200 handcrafted puzzles, along with meta puzzles that requires power of changing the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HInt system and Notebook : You can look up the knowledge you've learnt, or think about the essence of current level in Theta's dream.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/a6aa1aa12498ed2e6b6526b5529d5cea.poster.avif?t=1749409688\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/a6aa1aa12498ed2e6b6526b5529d5cea.webm?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/a6aa1aa12498ed2e6b6526b5529d5cea.mp4?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing Graphics. Sit down and take a rest if you're tired. (Even in darkest places!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/3233001d4b60919f1a0612fac917c248.poster.avif?t=1749409688\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/3233001d4b60919f1a0612fac917c248.webm?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/3233001d4b60919f1a0612fac917c248.mp4?t=1749409688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click &quot;Add To Wishlist&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official Discord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219580/extras/270346b7a1be9e26ebfcc50bf5b75a27.avif?t=1749409688\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></p>",
